#### GroupBy Window Aggregation

{{< label "Batch" >}} {{< label "Streaming" >}}

Groups and aggregates a table on a [group window](#group-windows) and possibly one or more grouping keys.

{{< tabs "groupbywindow" >}}
{{< tab "Java" >}}
